<div class="notes">
  <b>🚗 STEERING LOGIC (TANK/SKID STEERING):</b><br>
  • <span>Forward:</span> Both IBT-2 RPWM high, LPWM = 0<br>
  • <span>Reverse:</span> Both IBT-2 LPWM high, RPWM = 0<br>
  • <span>Turn Left:</span> IBT-2 #1 (left) stop or slow, IBT-2 #2 (right) full speed forward<br>
  • <span>Turn Right:</span> IBT-2 #2 (right) stop or slow, IBT-2 #1 (left) full speed forward<br>
  • <span>Spin in place:</span> IBT-2 #1 forward + IBT-2 #2 reverse simultaneously<br><br>
  <b>⚡ IMPORTANT:</b> Battery (−), ESP32 GND, IBT-2 #1 GND, IBT-2 #2 GND — all must be connected together at a single common ground point.
